{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And YHWH blessed you at my foot.</b> What you said — that YHWH blessed you at my foot — is undoubtedly true." "<b>And now.</b> Since El, blessed be He, blessed you for my sake." "<b>When shall I also do.</b> What blessed deed from Him for my household, as you did for my sake for your household — and the customary wage for shepherds will not suffice for this."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:36.518151319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}